A||||11||My7Fieros||What was the name of that TV show?||||11||
Z||000000||My7Fieros||07-08-2000||04:25 PM||||This one dates me....when I was about 4 or 5 (1976-77)...there was this kids show that came on Saturday mornings. It was about a group of people that drove this seriously junky buggy thing. Well, the buggy had one of those old fashion horns on the side..you know, brass rap around w/ the black thing you squeeze to make it honk. Anyway, undoubtably, the group would always get into some sort of dilema. But never fear! All they had to do was sqeeze the horn on that buggy, and VOILA! it would turn into this beautiful metallic green buggy and would come and save them! Of course every once in a while, someone would steel the horn, hence they were SOL until getting the horn back, placing it on the buggy, and, well you know.<BR>By the way, this was a real show, NOT a cartoon. WHAT WAS IT?!!!!||||reg||11
