Z||000011||Sleestak||07-13-2000||12:35 AM||||I only know of a few sites where Wonderbug is mentioned, nothing major, but probably worth checking out to rekindle those old memories.<P> <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/Hollywood/Hills/6009/wbug.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/Hollywood/Hills/6009/wbug.htm</A> <P>O.K., so make that one site!<P>Actually, I found this site in my stats the other day as a referring page to landofthelost.com. That link you threw in your post was enough that when someone used it to get to my site, this message board showed up in my stats.<P>And to think they have a whole boxed set of Sigmund and the Sea Monster out there but no Land of the Lost, it's a crying shame I tell you!<P>George<BR>Webmaster -  <A HREF="http://Landofthelost.com" TARGET=_blank>Landofthelost.com</A> <P>||||reg||12
